Z||000002||Greg Piet||07-04-2001||03:31 AM||||I did a 3.1 stroker...<BR>I have less than 1000 miles and I LOVE IT!!!!!<BR>Yeah Yeah Yeah a 350, or a bigger motor is better, but the 2.8 to 3.1 was sooo easy...<BR>no sensor mods, no wiring mods, just replace internal engine components, and she runs like a champ...  <BR>I must admit I did not go cheap, or get a stock cam, and I had a machine shop take care of the block for me.||||reg||1
